{"title":"FidgetBoss 4000's 2019 Mock AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>(fidgetboss_4000)</i> Mark rolled two standard dice. Given that he rolled two distinct values, find the probability that he rolled two primes.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9697bfc7706f170bf383d3df0a30a2b6b47a7a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{12}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{1}{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{2}{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"381\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/e/dbe36ab48eb2448f8b279bfb5c60f071208dbf11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{6}{2}=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"79\" height=\"53\" /> different ways Mark could roll two distinct values. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e78f0fbdcd23c47249963b83f7b45dc109adb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{3}{2}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"70\" height=\"53\" /> ways Mark could roll two distinct primes. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/69023f7ebfd8726876b3486d792b78fba7dd364f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{15}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{1}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"106\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B\" title=\"FidgetBoss 4000&#39;s 2019 Mock AMC 12B\">FidgetBoss 4000's 2019 Mock AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"FidgetBoss 4000&#39;s 2019 Mock AMC 12B Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"FidgetBoss 4000&#39;s 2019 Mock AMC 12B Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"FidgetBoss 4000&#39;s 2019 Mock AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FidgetBoss_4000%27s_2019_Mock_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"FidgetBoss 4000&#39;s 2019 Mock AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5 (pa